{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1148346-satyrs-and-shoes","id":1148346,"title":"Satyrs and shoes?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-09T10:16:09-07:00","id":1148346,"title":"Satyrs and shoes?","content":"With their chimerical hooves, can a Satyr still wear shoes in their mortal seeming? Or do they have to walk barefoot? Since the merit to have wings suggests that you need to cut holes in your clothes for the wings (even though they are chimerical), it made me wonder about Satyr's hooves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16478-tristerfalm","name":"tristerfalm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-09T14:33:43-07:00","id":1148440,"title":"","content":"Hooves can fit into shoes, or atleast most boots, so they could easily wear them even if they do prefer to go bare hooved when possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T13:52:46-07:00","id":1148899,"title":"","content":"The way I see it, mortal seeming and chimerical seeming are distinct (more or less) so even if a satyr cannot wear chimerical shoes (or can she ?), the mortal seeming still have feet and then she can wear real shoes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12595-nitenshi","name":"Nitenshi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-12T01:06:28-07:00","id":1149027,"title":"","content":"Or... Just get garment that is both a pair of nice shoes for human feet and satyr hooves as a chimerical quality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-12T01:26:13-07:00","id":1149031,"title":"","content":"I imagine, how it can be somewhat terrifying for a Satyr teenager...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-13T04:33:52-07:00","id":1149359,"title":"","content":"And now I want to play a boggan shoemaker. &quot;Young lady, don't you want to look both fabulous AND never worry about losing those high heels? And yes sir we also have them in your size.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12678-monkeydjie","name":"Monkeydjie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-07T15:43:44-08:00","id":1156815,"title":"","content":"I've known a few people in my life who almost never wear shoes. Like really... almost never. Curiously, one of them might go by the nickname Satyr... hmmm. Anyway, seems to me that a little Stealth or Chicanery could get a satyr by in most cases. So, I'd think that most satyrs would avoid except when absolutely necessary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13405-grand-pooka","name":"Grand Pooka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13405_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-13T02:22:04-08:00","id":1158112,"title":"","content":"You could rule that by the subtle magic of the Dreaming, humans see satyr hooves and rationalise them as boots. Thus, fae see hooves. Everyone else sees boots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5